  Facts (<file:line> each): 10.77.1.128/25 = WireGuard clients; 10.77.1.0/24 = whole VPN,
  including OpenVPN clients; the front-door allow-list uses the /24. Nothing is deployed.
  a) 10.77.1.128/25 — admits WireGuard clients only; differs from the front-door list.
     Cost if wrong: a legitimate sender outside the /25 is dropped until changed.
     Rollback: one-line change, PR, redeploy.
  b) 10.77.1.0/24 — admits WireGuard and OpenVPN clients; same as the front-door list.
     Cost if wrong: non-WireGuard hosts can reach the relay until changed.
